      "text": "The Mukhyamantri Vigyan Pratibha Pariksha is conducted annually by The\nDirectorate of Education, GNCT of Delhi, for students studying in Class-IXᵗʰ. It is meant to\nidentify and nurture the talented students studying in class IXᵗʰ."
